{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>When you slaughter a slaughter-offering of well-being.</b> It is joined with the verse above, because they shall not slaughter to shedim, not a god, but to HaShem alone. And the reason for the plural form תזבחו is that Scripture typically speaks of men joining together for a single offering:" "And the meaning of <b>for your acceptance</b> is that they bring the offering willingly and not under compulsion:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:53.299548650Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}